OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe some brighter spells and an
OL,7,Fisolated shower to end the day, these
OL,8,Fmainly in western areas. Rather cloudy
OL,9,Fovernight, with isolated showers
OL,10,Flingering in the north and over high
OL,11,Fground. Remaining fairly breezy,
OL,12,Fthough mild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FApart from an early light
OL,15,Fshower in the north, Monday promises
OL,16,Fto be generally dry with bright or
OL,17,Fsunny spells, mainly further east.
OL,18,FFeeling quite warm in the westerly
OL,19,Fbreeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
