OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBar
OL,6,Fan isolated shower, the weather looks
OL,7,Fmostly dry and settled during the
OL,8,Fperiod. There will be variable cloud
OL,9,Fand some sunny spells, and it will
OL,10,Ffeel increasing warm again.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
